<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 12pt"><B><U>NLS
PHARMACEUTICS LTD. (CHE-447.067.367)</U></B></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><B>TO BE RETURNED</B> TO NLS PHARMACEUTICS LTD.,
DULY COMPLETED AND SIGNED AS PROVIDED IN THE INVITATION DATED 23 AUGUST 2024, <B>LATEST BY 17 SEPTEMBER 2024 (RECEIVED BY 11:59PM CET).</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The extraordinary shareholders&rsquo; meeting of NLS Pharmaceutics
Ltd. will be held as follows:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center; width: 8%"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&minus;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 14%"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>Date:</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 78%"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">18 September 2024</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
